verify_steps: PROBE: `curl -s -D - -X GET -H "Origin: https://evil.example.com" "https://api.sparelabs.com/v1/global/organizations"` (expect 200 + ACAO+ACAC); `curl -s -D - -X POST -H "Authorization: Bearer x" "https://api.sparelabs.com/v1/global/organizations"` (expect 401 InvalidTokenError); `curl -s -D - -H "Origin: https://evil.example.com" "https://api.sparelabs.com/v1/journeys"` (expect 401).
